    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Koolecha būsaamiwa ūmo būlī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūnizīīla, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'wana wa munhū, ū bebe ūkikalaga hamò na banhū bagomi; a miso ga kūbonela balī nago alīyo batabonaga, na a matū ga kwigwīīla balī nago alīyo batigwaga; nguno balī banhū bagomi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū ng'wana wa munhū, tungīlaga ī shikolo shako kūlwa saama y'ihadīke, nīyo wīte līīmi nyange balībona. Būūkaga wīnge aho ūlī, ūje ipandī līngī; hamo bakūdeeba nūūlū īkī bashitiigwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikanza lya līīmi balībona ūkūshifunya ī shikolo shako shitungile kūlwa saama y'ihadīke. Hūna ū mu makanza ga mhīndī īngaga balolile, ūje gīt'abo bakajaga bo kūsaamiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chibūlaga ipūndū mu ndugu balīībona, ūlashifunīje henaho ī shikolo shako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ng'wikanza lya kamunhū ūyo ūkūshisesela ha mabega nabo balībona ūshibūūche ūgumhe ūjile. Ūkwikundīkīja ū kū miso gako ūtizībona ī sī, nguno naakwītaga kūbiza shimanīkījo ū kū numba ya Isilaeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana nīta gīt'ūmò nakalagīīlīlwa, makanza ga līīmi nūshitunga ī shikolo shane nūshifunya hanze kūlwa būsaami; ī mhīndī nūchibūla na nkono gwane ipūndū mu ndugu. Ikanza lya kamunhū ūyo nūshisesela ī shikolo shane ha mabega balīlola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha ntondo dilū ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūnizīīla, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'wana wa munhū, a banhū ba numba ya Isilaeli a bashitiigwa batakūbūūgije gīkī, ‘Ūlīta kī?’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū bawīlage, “Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, ‘Ū mhayo gwenūyū gūlī kūlwa nguno ya nsugi wa mu Yelusalemu, na a banhū ba numba yose ī ya Isilaeli abo bakikalaga moi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawīlage gīkī, ‘Ū nene nalī būmanīkījo ū kū bing'we.’ Ūmo nakīītīla ng'wenūmu, h'ūmo bakwītīlwa na a boi. Bakūsaamiwa baje bakabize nding'wa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nsugi akūbiza hamò nabo, nang'hwe akūsesela ha mabega ī shikolo shakwe mu makanza ga kamunhū ūūyo abūūke lūgendo; līkūchibūlwa ipūndū mu ndugu abītīle henaho. Akwikundīkīja ū kū būshū bokwe atizībona ī sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūgoloola ikila lyane līngobanīje; lūkūmpuja ū lūtu lwane nantwale Babuloni kū sī ya Bakalidayo, gwike atībona. Akūjūchīla kwenūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū bakwe pye a bose: A ban'ikūlū bakwe na a bashilikale bakwe, nakūbasambaaja kūja hose hose, hūna nabasolele lūshū naje nakūbakūūbījaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ūlū nūbabbalasanya mu mahanga na kūbasambaaja kū ma sī ga kūle hū bakūdeeba gīkī ū nene nalī SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū kūfuma ū mu būlūūgū nī nzala na a mabūsaatu nakūlekeela bagehu babo, ū kū mahanga ūko balaaje bayūbona gīkī ī shīītīle shabo shilī sha malofu no. Hūna bakūdeeba gīkī ū nene nalī SEEBA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūnizīīla hangī gūlīhaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'wana wa munhū, ūlū ī shilīwa shako lyaga mu boobà, na a minzī ūyūng'wa ūkūdetemaga kūlwa boobà. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawīlage a banhū ba sī ya ng'wing'we, ‘Ū Seeba MULUNGU alībawīla a banhū abo balī Yelusalemu na mu sī ya Isilaeli; alīhaya gīkī, Bakūyūlya ī shilīwa mu boobà na a minzī bakūyūng'wa mu kūzwangana. Nguno ī shikolo sha mu sī yabo shikūkenaagūlwa, kūlwa wiboneeji wa banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mizengo īkūbiza dalali ītī na banhū, nī sī īkūbiza buyīkī. Hūna mukūdeeba gīkī ū nene nalī SEEBA.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūnizīīla hangī gūlīhaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'wana wa munhū, lūlīho lūsumo mukalūtūmamīlīlaga mu sī ya Isilaeli; lūhayile, ‘Ī shikū jikūmanagūbīta dūhū alīyo būlī shakoolechiwa ndūhū ūkūshikīīla;’ ū lūsumo lwenūlo lwa nīmo kī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawīlage gīkī, ‘Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya, Ū lūsumo lwenūlo nakūlwīnja; na batalūtūmamīla hangī ū mu Isilaeli.’ Bawīlage, ‘Ī shikū jashikaga būlī shakoolechiwa shishikīlījiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ī shakoolechiwa sha nyalomolomo shitūbiza ho hangī, nū būchūja bo kūlembagūla banhū ū mu Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū nene SEEBA nakūhaya ūyo natogilwe, nīyo gūkūshikīīla. Hangī nīyo gūtūdīīla, hama ū mu shikū jing'we a bing'we ba numba ya būshitiigwa, nakūyūgūhaya ū mhayo naagūshikīlīja; alīhaya Seeba MULUNGU.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.25",
